  "source": "rem N-Queens\nrem Place N queens so that none attack each other.\n\nuse sequences\nuse text\nuse io\n\nSize = 8\n\nCols = 0 till Size array\n\nrem Each row of States holds the columns of the queens placed so far.\nrem Start with Size placements of one queen, one for each possible column.\nStates = Cols reshape Size 1\n\nrem Add a queen in the next row to every board, once per free column.\nfor Row in 1 till Size\n  Dy = Row till 0 by -1\n  hit Q = concat Q (Q + Dy) (Q - Dy)\n  avail Q = Cols not in Q hit\n  Free = States avail rank 1\n  Where = Free indices\n\n  Previous = States (Where # 0)\n  Column = (Where # 1) reshape (Where len) 1\n  States = concat Previous Column axis 1\nend\n\nStates copy\n",
